# Normalize text to LF in the repository and in every checkout, on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored upstream skills: their whitespace (markdown hard line breaks, a trailing blank line) is
# intentional and hash-pinned in .agents/skill-sources.json, so whitespace checks are off for these files only.
.agents/skills/vercel-react-best-practices/** -whitespace
.claude/skills/vercel-react-best-practices/** -whitespace
.agents/skills/ui-taste/** -whitespace
.claude/skills/ui-taste/** -whitespace
